   if(a==414){JourneyHint(journeyRooms[27].cleared?"靠近地心炉门石阶按 F，前往第三层":"先救出阿铎、放下撤离桥并平息锻链巨匠");}
   BuildChapterActions();if(a==411){BeginBridgeLowering();BeginWorkerEvacuation();}if(a==410||a==411)PlayWinchTurn(a==410?new Vector2(-3.8f,-.4f):EvacuationWinchAt);UpdateExplorationDoors();RequestCheckpoint();SaveChapterCheckpoint(false);
  }
